Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:10.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,PadCraft is a browser engineering workstation that designs a complete R P twenty forty macropad from one normalized configuration.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.17,0:00:21.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,The same model drives the circuit board, the switch plate, the enclosure source, every manufacturing layer and both firmware exports, entirely offline in one tab.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.36,0:00:25.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,Four showcase designs ship with the workstation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.14,0:00:38.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,A twelve key studio controller, a six key sensor console with analog channels, a low profile pocket instrument, and a forty eight key stress test that maxes out the matrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:42.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,One click regenerates every artifact for the chosen design.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:49.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,Hover any pad to read its reference, net and drill size, and click to isolate that net.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.60,0:01:00.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,Dashed airwires mark the controller and peripheral connections still to route in KiCad, while the meter counts connected pad groups against what remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.86,0:01:09.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,Rows drive low and columns sense through a C O L two R O W matrix, with a diode per key and pins drawn from the legal G P I O pools.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.25,0:01:16.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,Rows, columns, pitch, switch footprint and peripherals all flow into the exports.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.26,0:01:29.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,The design rule audit checks pitch, enclosure, plate webs, the controller bay, drills, pin legality, keycodes, firmware polarity and copper clearance, and names every finding in the open.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.13,0:01:35.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,The output panel lists twenty five portable artifacts for one design.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.34,0:01:51.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,A KiCad eight board with resolved pad nets, seven Gerber layers, plated and non plated drill files, a watertight S T L plate, OpenSCAD source, K M K and Q M K firmware, a fingerprinted bill of materials and a sealed layout proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.73,0:01:58.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,The D F M lab benchmarks the shipped presets and four stress matrices against the real engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.58,0:02:07.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,Two charts plot the matrix scaling frontier and a manufacturing breakdown, and every row or marker loads that exact design.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.56,0:02:15.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,A proof brief seals the design under one S H A 256 digest, checked by twenty four in page self tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:22.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,Four hundred eighty nine Node tests pass with zero failures, re verified inside this recording run.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.03,0:02:28.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,PadCraft. One design, every layer, built for people who build hardware.
